---@field groups? archil.GrepDiskResultGroupsList Matches with their context lines, grouped the way grep prints them. Present only when `contextBefore` or `contextAfter` is set. Holds the same matches as `matches`. When the search stops at `maxResults`, the last group ends up to `contextAfter` lines after its last kept match, and any matches in those lines are shown as context. Each line of a group counts toward the 32 MiB response limit, so large context and `maxResults` multiply it.
